Package: txsos
Title: Texas Secretary of State Precinct-Level Election Returns
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Shiro", "Kuriwaki", , "shirokuriwaki@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools to build a precinct-level database of Texas historical
    primary and general election returns. Fetches machine-readable returns
    from the Texas Legislative Council / Capitol Data Portal (the source
    behind the Secretary of State returns), reshapes them into a normalized
    precinct / candidate / votes schema stored as Parquet, aligns candidate
    and district identifiers with the CAGE ("Candidates in American General
    Elections") naming format, and validates general-election totals.
